---
---

<section id="about" class="about">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="about-grid">
      <div class="about-left">
        <p class="section-label">// 001</p>
        <h2 class="section-title">Sobre mí</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="about-right">
        <div class="about-content">
          <p class="about-text-large">
            Construyo y arreglo sistemas donde el dinero tiene que moverse bien:
            wallets, pasarelas de pago, señales de trading.
          </p>

          <p class="about-text">
            Cloudflare Workers, TypeScript y Python. Integraciones reales con
            Wompi, Bancolombia y Truora — no maquetas, producción con dinero real.
          </p>

          <p class="about-text">
            Prefiero verificar en vivo antes que confiar en un test en verde.
            Los proyectos de abajo, con sus fallas reales encontradas y corregidas,
            son la prueba.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="about-details">
          <div class="about-details-head">
            <span class="about-details-dot"></span>
            cat ./status.json
          </div>
          <div class="detail-item">
            <span class="detail-label">ubicacion</span>
            <span class="detail-value">"Medellín, Colombia"</span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-item">
            <span class="detail-label">disponibilidad</span>
            <span class="detail-value available">"abierto_a_proyectos"</span>
          </div>
          <div class="detail-item">
            <span class="detail-label">especialidad</span>
            <span class="detail-value">"Fintech / Pagos / Cloudflare Workers"</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="about-cta">
          <a href="#contact" class="btn btn-primary">Hablemos →</a>
          <a href="https://github.com/dsltdev" class="btn btn-secondary" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub ↗</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .about-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .about-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .about-text-large {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .about-text {
    color: var(--muted);
    line-height: 1.8;
  }

  .about-details {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-strong);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .about-details-head {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.55rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.25rem;
    background: var(--surface2);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .about-details-dot {
    width: 6px;
    height: 6px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
  }

  .detail-item {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.9rem 1.25rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-left: 2px solid transparent;
    transition: border-color 0.2s ease, background 0.2s ease;
  }

  .detail-item:last-child {
    border-bottom: none;
  }

  .detail-item:hover {
    border-left-color: var(--accent);
    background: var(--glass-bg);
  }

  .detail-label {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.03em;
    color: var(--muted-dim);
  }

  .detail-value {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: var(--text);
    text-align: right;
  }

  .detail-value.available {
    color: var(--success);
  }

  .about-cta {
    display: flex;
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  @media (max-width: 768px) {
    .about-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 2rem;
    }
  }

  @media (prefers-reduced-transparency: reduce) {
    .about-details {
      background: rgba(12, 22, 16, 0.98);
      backdrop-filter: none;
      -webkit-backdrop-filter: none;
    }
  }
</style>
